window.__DOCSIFY_OFFLINE_DATA__ = {"content":{"README.md":"# 文档中心\n\n<div class=\"workspace-home\">\n<p class=\"workspace-eyebrow\">ENGINEERING KNOWLEDGE BASE</p>\n<p class=\"workspace-intro\">从目录浏览，或直接搜索文件、命令与技术细节。</p>\n<div class=\"workspace-stats\"><span>6 篇文档</span><span>4 个文件夹</span><span>离线可用</span></div>\n</div>\n\n## 文件夹\n\n<div class=\"workspace-folder-grid\">\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">2 篇文档</span>\n<h3>使用说明</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">快速开始 · 绘图示例</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E5%AF%84%E5%AD%98%E5%99%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">2 篇文档</span>\n<h3>硬件设计</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">寄存器手册 · 时钟树设计</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%93%BE/%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%93%BE.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">1 篇文档</span>\n<h3>软件工具链</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">编译工具链</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">1 篇文档</span>\n<h3>验证指南</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">仿真环境搭建</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n## 快速查阅\n\n- **Ctrl/Cmd + K** 或 **/**：全文搜索；**Ctrl/Cmd + P**：按文件名或路径打开。\n- 在搜索框下选择文件夹或当前文档缩小范围，多词同时匹配；`\"exact phrase\"` 精确短语，`-排除词` 排除内容。\n- 阅读搜索结果后用 **F3 / Shift+F3** 跳转命中；**Esc** 关闭搜索或退出命中阅读。\n- 侧栏筛选文件名与路径，使用「定位当前」返回当前文件；拖动侧栏边缘调整宽度。\n- 阅读区右上角「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML（样式内联、图片与图形内嵌）。\n\n## 绘图工具\n\n- [绘图语法示例](md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)：Mermaid 与 PacketDiag 的语法与示例。\n- <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a>：编辑语法实时预览，可下载 SVG / PNG。\n\n## 离线维护\n\n直接双击 `index.html` 即可查阅，分发时复制整个 `docs/` 文件夹。源文档放在 `docs/md/`，可以按项目、模块建立多层目录。\n\n新增、删除或编辑文档后运行 `python setup_docsify.py`，再刷新页面。页面「重读索引」只更新已知文档或当前内嵌快照，不扫描磁盘新增文件。依赖齐全时构建不联网。\n\n<details class=\"workspace-all-docs\">\n<summary>完整文档索引</summary>\n\n## 文档列表\n\n- **使用说明**\n  - [快速开始](md/使用说明/快速开始.md)\n  - [绘图示例](md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)\n- **硬件设计**\n  - [寄存器手册](md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md)\n  - [时钟树设计](md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md)\n- **软件工具链**\n  - [编译工具链](md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md)\n- **验证指南**\n  - [仿真环境搭建](md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md)\n\n</details>\n\n","_sidebar.md":"- **文档列表**\n  - **使用说明**\n    - [快速开始](/md/使用说明/快速开始.md)\n    - [绘图示例](/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)\n  - **硬件设计**\n    - [寄存器手册](/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md)\n    - [时钟树设计](/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md)\n  - **软件工具链**\n    - [编译工具链](/md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md)\n  - **验证指南**\n    - [仿真环境搭建](/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md)\n","md/使用说明/快速开始.md":"# 快速开始\n\n欢迎使用 md2web。把 Markdown 放进 `docs/md/`，运行构建脚本即可生成完全离线的文档站。\n\n## 阅读区工具栏\n\n每篇文档右上角都有一排按钮：\n\n- **复制路径**：复制该文档在仓库中的路径，便于在编辑器里打开\n- **编辑 MD**：打开双栏编辑器——左侧 Markdown 源码按格式分色（标题层级、列表、代码块、公式），右侧实时预览（Mermaid、PacketDiag、KaTeX 公式、代码高亮）；`Ctrl+S` 直接写回 `docs/md/` 源文件（预览服务会自动重建），也支持另存为、下载、复制、还原与重新加载\n- **下载 MD**：下载当前页面对应的 Markdown 源文件\n- **下载本页**：把当前文档导出为自包含 HTML（含图片、图形与目录，可离线转发）\n- **宽屏阅读** / **隐藏序号**：切换阅读布局与标题编号\n\n编辑器常用快捷键：`Ctrl+B` 加粗 · `Ctrl+I` 斜体 · `Ctrl+K` 链接 · `Ctrl+M` 行内公式 · `Ctrl+Shift+M` 公式块 · `Ctrl+Alt+1/2/3` 标题 · `Ctrl+Shift+U`/`Ctrl+Shift+O` 无序/有序列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+K` 任务列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+C` 代码块 · `Ctrl+Shift+G` Mermaid · `Ctrl+Shift+D` PacketDiag · `Ctrl+S` 保存 · `Ctrl+/` 全部快捷键。\n\n> 直连保存仅在 `python serve.py` 的本机预览下可用（局域网其他机器访问时接口拒绝写入）；`file://` 双击模式会改为「保存到文件」或下载。\n\n左侧栏顶部还有「绘图预览」入口（<a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lib/plot-playground.html</a>），可在线试写 Mermaid / PacketDiag 并下载图片。\n\n## AI 助手\n\n右下角「AI 助手」按钮（或 `Ctrl+Shift+A`）打开对话面板：它会先在本地 `search-index.json` 中检索相关章节，再把资料片段与问题一起发给您配置的大模型，回答下方列出引用来源，点击即可跳转。\n\n配置入口在**左侧栏顶部的 `AI 配置` 图标**（对话面板右上角「⚙ 配置」同样可打开），包含：\n\n- **服务商与密钥**：OpenAI 兼容 / DeepSeek / Ollama 本机 / Anthropic / 自定义，填写接口地址、模型、API Key、温度、系统提示与请求方式，点「保存并测试」验证连通性\n- **资料范围**：按文件夹/文档勾选，回答只依据所选资料（不勾选 = 使用全部文档）\n- **上传文档**：可选择本机的 `.md` / `.markdown` / `.txt` 加入检索（单个 ≤ 256 KB、合计 ≤ 512 KB，仅保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会上传或提交到仓库）；上传文档会出现在资料范围的「upload://」分组中\n- API Key 只保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会写入仓库或上传服务端；公开仓库请勿把 Key 提交进任何文件\n- 请求方式默认「自动」：浏览器直连失败（通常是跨域）时自动改走本机 `serve.py` 的 `/__ai/chat` 代理（仅本机可调用）\n- 完全离线（双击 `index.html`）时检索仍可用，但调用模型需要网络，且只能直连、不能走本机代理\n- 快捷动作：「总结本页」「文档概览」「解释选中」（选中正文文字后点击）\n\n## 数学公式\n\n行内公式用 `$...$`，独立公式块用 `$$...$$`，由 KaTeX 离线渲染：\n\n行内：$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\n\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-x^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$\n\n## 目录约定\n\n- `docs/md/` 是唯一需要维护的目录，可自由创建子文件夹\n- 图片无需登记，放在文档旁边或任意位置，用相对路径引用即可，例如 `![](images/flow.png)`\n- 构建只处理 `.md` 文档；图片由浏览器直接加载\n\n## 构建与预览\n\n```\npython setup_docsify.py\npython serve.py\n```\n\n也可以直接双击 `docs/index.html` 浏览（file:// 模式，内容与搜索索引已内嵌）：该模式为**离线只读**，保留搜索、图形、公式与下载能力。\n\n## 登录与编辑权限\n\n只读预览（`python serve.py`）不提供任何写接口。需要网页编辑时，用认证服务启动：\n\n```\npython -m pip install -r server/requirements.txt     # 仅服务机需要（Flask + Waitress）\npython3 serve.py                                     # Linux 推荐用 python3（3.8+ 可开认证编辑；3.6 只会读预览）\npython serve.py                                      # Windows / 默认启动认证编辑服务（配置不存在会自动生成）\npython serve.py --preview                            # 只读预览（无写接口）\n```\n\n启动后刷新页面：\n\n1. 侧栏顶部「设置」→ 用管理员账号登录（首次为 **admin / admin**，登录后请立即在窗口底部修改密码）。\n2. 在「SVN 认证路径」填入管理员准备的路由（必须是**强制账号密码认证**的路径，可点「测试认证路径」验证；允许匿名访问的路径会被拒绝）。\n3. 在「仓库映射」中填写 docs 目录与 SVN 地址（按目录段最长前缀匹配，如 `md/硬件设计` → hardware 库）。\n4. 按需填写「AI 助手」默认值（接口地址/模型/Key，会下发给所有登录用户），保存即可生效，无需重启。\n\n之后：\n\n- 匿名读者仍可浏览、搜索、下载；右上角显示「登录」。\n- 编辑者用**自己的 SVN 账号密码**登录（服务端通过认证路径验证，口令不落库、不缓存、不进命令行）。\n- 登录后打开编辑器：`Ctrl+S` 保存的是**个人草稿**（带版本号，其他标签页或本人更新会让旧版本保存返回冲突，不会覆盖）；工具条提供「历史」（草稿版本列表，可载入任一版本）、「差异」（已发布版本 ↔ 当前草稿的统一差异）、「载入最新」「放弃草稿」。草稿不会进入站点与搜索索引。\n- **插入图片**：工具栏「图片」可多选文件；在源码区直接 `Ctrl+V` 粘贴剪贴板图片也可。登录后图片自动保存到**当前文档同目录的 `img/`**（不存在会创建、重名自动加 `-1`），并插入 `![名称](img/文件名)`；离线（file://）模式改为内嵌 data URL 并在状态栏说明。\n- **没有 SVN 基线也能编辑**：文档在 `docs/md` 中尚未发布或所在目录未关联仓库时，编辑器会给出提示，可直接编辑并用 `Ctrl+S` 保存草稿；提交 SVN 时会作为新文件加入。\n- **提交 SVN**：编辑器右上角「提交 SVN…」→ 填写提交说明 → 审阅面板显示目标库、精确文件与统一差异 → 点「确认提交」用**自己的 SVN 账号**提交；成功后站点会自动重建。提交只包含这篇文档，不会夹带其他文件夹或其他人的改动；远端基线过期时会明确报错而不是覆盖。「SVN 日志」可按当前账号查看目标库日志。\n- **管理员**使用本机账号（默认 `admin / admin`）登录后同样可以编辑；提交时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号用于本次提交（口令只留在服务进程内存，立即用于验证与提交，不写入数据库）。\n- 会话默认 8 小时有效、闲置 30 分钟失效；服务重启后需重新登录。\n- 写接口全部经过登录 + CSRF 校验；源文件写回使用版本校验，不再有\"再次保存强制覆盖\"。\n- 修改 SVN 认证路径会让已有 SVN 用户会话失效（管理员会话保留以便继续配置）。\n\n> 阶段一（登录与只读边界）、阶段二（个人草稿、版本历史、差异）与阶段三（多库提交、私有工作副本、外部同步）已实现。工程师生成本地编辑与 SVN 提交的习惯不受影响，网站也不采集本地编辑过程。\n\n## 界面小技巧\n\n- 阅读区右上角的按钮行（复制路径 / 查看源码 / 编辑 MD / 下载 MD / 下载本页 / 显示序号）在向下滚动时会**固定在顶部**。\n- 「查看源码」无需登录：弹出窗口直接显示当前文档的 Markdown 源码，可编辑、实时预览，并「保存到本地」（不会改动服务端文档）。\n- 从搜索结果进入阅读模式时，命中工具条与按钮行会上下并排显示，互不遮挡；离开阅读模式后按钮行回到顶部。\n- 右侧「本文目录」固定**贴着窗口右缘**；其左边缘是可用鼠标拖动的调节线，向左拖变宽、向右拖变窄（宽度记忆在本机，刷新后保持）。\n- 搜索框放大镜右侧的 ⚙ 图标用于展开/收起「范围 / 模式」筛选（默认收起节省空间，筛选生效时图标高亮）。\n- 导出的独立 HTML 中，本文目录固定在**左侧导航**，正文在右侧滚动。目录会**高亮当前阅读的章节**并自动展开其上级；右上角有「隐藏」按钮，隐藏后屏幕右缘会出现「目录」小标签，点击即可恢复。分级标题左侧的箭头可折叠/展开子章节。\n- 绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可把左侧源码一键复制回文档；绘图示例中的每个图形都配有源码对照。\n- AI 助手面板：上传文档入口在**输入框上方**（不在配置弹窗里）；「历史」可查看与切换本机保存的历史对话，「新对话」开始一份新记录。\n- 设置入口：侧栏顶部 HOME 图标旁的单个「设置」图标（含 AI 配置）。窗口内可配置：**我的 AI 设置**（服务商/接口/模型/Key/代理策略/**参考源码路径**/资料范围，仅存本机浏览器）、**服务端设置**（管理员登录后配置 SVN 认证路径、仓库映射与全站 AI 默认值）、管理员改密。\n- 管理员登录：**本机管理员账号（默认 `admin / admin`）不需要 SVN 校验**，用页面右上角「登录」或设置窗口即可登录；侧栏会显示「管理员（本机）」。本机账号只能**本地编辑与保存草稿**；「提交 SVN…」时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号（仅本次合入使用，留在服务进程内存），因为仓库写入始终以真实 SVN 身份记录。\n- 首页（`#/`）由构建生成，编辑器只提供只读预览并提示改从左侧目录打开 `docs/md` 下的文档；文档路由不带 `.md`（docsify 会去掉后缀）也能正常编辑与保存。\n- 「参考源码路径」会随提问一起发给模型（如 `D:/repo/firmware` 或 `/srv/src/project`），便于 AI 回答时引用代码库位置。\n\n## 代码高亮\n\n```python\nprint(\"hello md2web\")\n```\n\n## Mermaid 图形\n\n围栏语言写 `mermaid` 即渲染为图形（离线本地渲染）：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[编写 Markdown] --> B[运行构建]\n  B --> C[离线浏览与搜索]\n```\n","md/使用说明/绘图示例.md":"# 绘图示例\n\n本文给出文档站支持的**全部绘图样例**：27 种 Mermaid 图形类型与 11 个 PacketDiag 模板，每个都提供「效果 + 源码」对照。源码可直接复制到 <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a> 中修改后再贴回文档。\n\n## Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）\n\n### 1. flowchart 流程图\n\n语法要点：节点 A[文本]、判断 B{条件}、子图 subgraph\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n```\n\n### 2. sequenceDiagram 时序图\n\n语法要点：participant 参与者、->> 请求、-->> 响应\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n```\n\n### 3. classDiagram 类图\n\n语法要点：class 类、+属性/+方法、<|-- 继承\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n```\n\n### 4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图\n\n语法要点：[*] 起止状态、A --> B: 事件\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n```\n\n### 5. erDiagram ER 图\n\n语法要点：实体 ||--o{ 关系 : 标签、属性块\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n```\n\n### 6. journey 用户旅程\n\n语法要点：section 阶段、任务: 评分: 角色\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n```\n\n### 7. gantt 甘特图\n\n语法要点：dateFormat、section、任务: 状态, id, 开始, 时长\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n```\n\n### 8. pie 饼图\n\n语法要点：pie title、\"标签\" : 数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n```\n\n### 9. quadrantChart 四象限\n\n语法要点：x-axis/y-axis、quadrant-1..4、数据点 [x, y]\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n```\n\n### 10. requirementDiagram 需求图\n\n语法要点：requirement { id/text/risk/verifymethod }、element、关系；文本值需加引号\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n```\n\n### 11. gitGraph 提交图\n\n语法要点：commit、branch、checkout、merge\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n```\n\n### 12. mindmap 思维导图\n\n语法要点：root((中心)) 与缩进层级\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n```\n\n### 13. timeline 时间线\n\n语法要点：标题、时间 : 事件 : 事件\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n```\n\n### 14. sankey 桑基图\n\n语法要点：CSV 三列：来源,目标,数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n```\n\n### 15. xychart XY 图\n\n语法要点：x-axis 分类、y-axis 范围、bar/line 数据\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n```\n\n### 16. block 块图\n\n语法要点：columns 列数、块定义、--> 连线\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n```\n\n### 17. packet 报文图\n\n语法要点：packet-beta、位范围: \"字段\"\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n```\n\n### 18. architecture 架构图\n\n语法要点：group/service(icon)[标题]、:L -- R: 连线\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n```\n\n### 19. C4 上下文图\n\n语法要点：Person/System/Rel 声明\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n```\n\n### 20. kanban 看板\n\n语法要点：列[标题] 与缩进任务[描述]\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n```\n\n### 21. radar 雷达图\n\n语法要点：axis id[\"维度\"]、curve id[\"名称\"]{数值}、max 上限\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n```\n\n### 22. treemap 矩形树图\n\n语法要点：层级标题 + \"叶子\": 数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n```\n\n### 23. wardley 战略图\n\n语法要点：anchor/component 名称 [可见度, 演进度]、-> 依赖（名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n```\n\n### 24. cynefin 决策域\n\n语法要点：complex/complicated/clear/chaotic/confusion 与条目\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n```\n\n### 25. eventmodeling 事件建模\n\n语法要点：tf 序号 类型 名称（ui/cmd/evt/readmodel 等，名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n```\n\n### 26. treeView 目录树\n\n语法要点：treeView-beta 与缩进层级（带 / 为目录）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n```\n\n### 27. info 版本信息\n\n语法要点：仅显示 Mermaid 版本\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ninfo\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ninfo\n```\n\n> 未包含的实验类型（如 `venn`、`ishikawa`、`railroad-*`、`flowchart-elk`）在当前 Mermaid 版本下不稳定或需要额外插件，绘图预览页的下拉框中亦未收录。\n\n## PacketDiag 报文图\n\n围栏语言写 `packetdiag`，使用标准 [packetdiag](http://blockdiag.com/en/nwdiag/packetdiag-examples.html) 语法；字段格式为 `bit[-end]: 标签 [选项]`。\n\n### 1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 2. TCP 头部（tcp）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 4. UDP 头部（udp）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 6. 标准示例（standard）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n### 7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n```\n\n### 8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n```\n\n### 9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n```\n\n### 10. 扩展：desctable 描述表\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 11. 扩展：字段属性演示\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n```\n\n### 常用选项\n\n| 选项 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `color` | 填充色 | `[color = \"#dbeafe\"]` |\n| `textcolor` | 文字色 | `[textcolor = \"red\"]` |\n| `rotate` | 标签旋转 90/270 | `[rotate = 270]` |\n| `colheight` | 高度倍数 1–12 | `[colheight = 3]` |\n| `label` | 显示名 | `[label = \"Src Port\"]` |\n| `description` | 生成字段说明表 | `[description = \"RFC 793\"]` |\n| `style` | 边框样式 | `[style = \"dashed\"]` |\n\n### 全局配置与增强语法\n\n| 语法 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `colwidth = 32;` | 每列宽度 |\n| `node_height = 48;` | 行高 |\n| `default_fontsize = 12;` | 默认字号 |\n| `scale_interval = 10;` | 位标尺间隔 |\n| `numbering = \"global\"` / `\"local\"` | 全局编号 / 按行编号 |\n| `bit_order = \"desc\"` | 位序反转（配合升序范围使用） |\n| `// @row: 名称` | 按行分段标题 |\n| `// @left: 文本` | 左侧注释 |\n| `desctable { 名称 = \"说明\" }` | 字段说明表 |\n\n> 图形均可点击放大查看；Mermaid 支持下载 SVG / PNG，PacketDiag 支持下载 PNG。绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可一键把源码复制回文档；阅读区右上角的「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML 文件。\n","md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md":"# 寄存器手册\n\n本文档描述芯片内各模块的寄存器定义与读写约束。\n\n## 地址映射\n\n基址寄存器的读写通过 MMIO 完成，偏移地址见下表。所有寄存器默认小端排列。\n\n配置寄存器前需复位对应时钟域，否则写入可能被忽略。\n\n## 中断控制器\n\n中断使能寄存器位于偏移 0x100，未屏蔽前不产生中断请求。\n\n状态寄存器为只读，写 1 清除对应中断标志。\n\n## 引脚复用\n\n引脚功能选择寄存器默认关闭所有复用功能，上电后引脚处于高阻状态。\n\n## 电气特性\n\n工作电压范围 1.8V 至 3.3V，超出范围可能损坏器件。\n","md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md":"# 时钟树设计\n\n## PLL配置\n\nPLL 倍频系数写入配置寄存器后需等待锁定指示位。\n\n分频寄存器控制各外设时钟域的分频比。\n\n## 低功耗模式\n\n时钟门控用于低功耗模式，关断空闲外设的时钟。\n","md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md":"# 编译工具链\n\n内容\n","md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md":"# 仿真环境搭建\n\n## 步骤一\n\n内容\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    %% 定义全局样式\n    classDef box fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#5A8FD3,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#2A5CAA,font-size:13px;\n    classDef subGraphStyle fill:#F0F4F8,stroke:#5A8FD3,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;\n\n    %% ----------------阶段一：Ingress 处理----------------\n    subgraph INGRESS [1. CPP Ingress Pipeline / 报文进入端]\n        direction LR\n        HMN(\"HPP MACI NOC\"):::box\n        AM_IN(\"AUX MAC\"):::box\n        CPIS_IN(\"CPIS\"):::box\n        IPDP(\"IPFIX DP\"):::box\n        \n        CM_IN(\"CPP MACI\"):::box\n        CIP(\"CPP Ingress Pipeline\"):::box\n        CMIRX(\"CPP MIRX\"):::box\n        \n        %% Ingress 本地的 HPP 旁路流向\n        CMN(\"CPP MACI NOC\"):::box\n        HIMR(\"HPP Ingress<br>MACI RX x16\"):::box\n\n        HMN -- \"HPP EGRESS<br>MIRROR x1\" --> CM_IN\n        AM_IN -- \"AUX CPU报文/标准二三层报文/<br>带互通头二三层报文 x2\" --> CM_IN\n        CPIS_IN -- \"FW CPU报文/<br>HOST CPU报文 x1\" --> CM_IN\n        IPDP -- \"IPFIX 报文 x1\" --> CM_IN\n\n        CM_IN -- \"标准/带互通头<br>二三层报文\" --> CMN --> HIMR\n        CM_IN -- \"CPU报文/<br>EGRESS MIRROR报文\" --> CIP --> CMIRX\n    end\n\n    %% ----------------阶段二：核心调度与跨 DIE----------------\n    subgraph FABRIC [2. XMMU & Fabric / 核心调度与跨DIE层]\n        direction LR\n        XMMU(\"XMMU\"):::box\n        CMCE(\"CPP MCE\"):::box\n        SUCIE_OUT(\"SPARE UCIE x2<br>(跨DIE输出)\"):::box\n        \n        UCIE_IN(\"N/E DATA UCIE X16<br>N/E SPARE UCIE X1<br>(其他DIE输入)\"):::box\n\n        %% 来自 Ingress 的输入\n        CMIRX -- \"跨DIE报文\" --> SUCIE_OUT\n        CMIRX -- \"本DIE报文、<br>MIRROR报文\" --> XMMU\n        \n        %% 来自其他 DIE 的输入\n        UCIE_IN --> XMMU\n        \n        XMMU --> CMCE\n        CMCE --> SUCIE_OUT\n    end\n\n    %% ----------------阶段三：Egress 处理----------------\n    subgraph EGRESS [3. CPP Egress Pipeline / 报文发送端]\n        direction LR\n        CTM(\"CPP TM\"):::box\n        CMITX(\"CPP MITX\"):::box\n        CEP(\"CPP Egress Pipeline\"):::box\n        CM_OUT(\"CPP MACI\"):::box\n        \n        SP_HPP(\"SP HPP Egress x1\"):::box\n        \n        AM_OUT(\"AUX MAC\"):::box\n        CPIS_OUT(\"CPIS\"):::box\n\n        %% MCE 与 XMMU 向 TM (Traffic Manager) 注入报文\n        CMCE --> CTM\n        XMMU -- \"上送CPU报文\" --> CTM\n        \n        CTM --> CMITX --> CEP --> CM_OUT\n        \n        SP_HPP -- \"AUX 普通二三层<br>出端口报文\" --> CM_OUT\n        \n        CM_OUT --> AM_OUT\n        CM_OUT --> CPIS_OUT\n    end\n    \n    %% 应用子图样式 (兼容部分 Mermaid 渲染器)\n    class INGRESS,FABRIC,EGRESS subGraphStyle;\n```"},"searchIndex":{"/":{"/?id=文档中心":{"slug":"/?id=文档中心","title":"文档中心","body":"<div class=\"workspace-home\">\n<p class=\"workspace-eyebrow\">ENGINEERING KNOWLEDGE BASE</p>\n<p class=\"workspace-intro\">从目录浏览，或直接搜索文件、命令与技术细节。</p>\n<div class=\"workspace-stats\"><span>6 篇文档</span><span>4 个文件夹</span><span>离线可用</span></div>\n</div>","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"文档中心"},"/?id=文件夹":{"slug":"/?id=文件夹","title":"文件夹","body":"<div class=\"workspace-folder-grid\">\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">2 篇文档</span>\n<h3>使用说明</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">快速开始 · 绘图示例</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E5%AF%84%E5%AD%98%E5%99%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">2 篇文档</span>\n<h3>硬件设计</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">寄存器手册 · 时钟树设计</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%93%BE/%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%93%BE.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">1 篇文档</span>\n<h3>软件工具链</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">编译工具链</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"workspace-folder-card\" href=\"#/md/%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA.md\">\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-count\">1 篇文档</span>\n<h3>验证指南</h3>\n<span class=\"workspace-folder-preview\">仿真环境搭建</span>\n</a>\n</div>","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"文件夹"},"/?id=快速查阅":{"slug":"/?id=快速查阅","title":"快速查阅","body":"- **Ctrl/Cmd + K** 或 **/**：全文搜索；**Ctrl/Cmd + P**：按文件名或路径打开。\n- 在搜索框下选择文件夹或当前文档缩小范围，多词同时匹配；`\"exact phrase\"` 精确短语，`-排除词` 排除内容。\n- 阅读搜索结果后用 **F3 / Shift+F3** 跳转命中；**Esc** 关闭搜索或退出命中阅读。\n- 侧栏筛选文件名与路径，使用「定位当前」返回当前文件；拖动侧栏边缘调整宽度。\n- 阅读区右上角「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML（样式内联、图片与图形内嵌）。","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"快速查阅"},"/?id=绘图工具":{"slug":"/?id=绘图工具","title":"绘图工具","body":"- [绘图语法示例](md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)：Mermaid 与 PacketDiag 的语法与示例。\n- <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a>：编辑语法实时预览，可下载 SVG / PNG。","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"绘图工具"},"/?id=离线维护":{"slug":"/?id=离线维护","title":"离线维护","body":"直接双击 `index.html` 即可查阅，分发时复制整个 `docs/` 文件夹。源文档放在 `docs/md/`，可以按项目、模块建立多层目录。\n\n新增、删除或编辑文档后运行 `python setup_docsify.py`，再刷新页面。页面「重读索引」只更新已知文档或当前内嵌快照，不扫描磁盘新增文件。依赖齐全时构建不联网。\n\n<details class=\"workspace-all-docs\">\n<summary>完整文档索引</summary>","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"离线维护"},"/?id=文档列表":{"slug":"/?id=文档列表","title":"文档列表","body":"- **使用说明**\n  - [快速开始](md/使用说明/快速开始.md)\n  - [绘图示例](md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)\n- **硬件设计**\n  - [寄存器手册](md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md)\n  - [时钟树设计](md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md)\n- **软件工具链**\n  - [编译工具链](md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md)\n- **验证指南**\n  - [仿真环境搭建](md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md)\n\n</details>","route":"/","pageTitle":"文档中心","headingTitle":"文档列表"}},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md":{"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=快速开始":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=快速开始","title":"快速开始","body":"欢迎使用 md2web。把 Markdown 放进 `docs/md/`，运行构建脚本即可生成完全离线的文档站。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"快速开始"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=阅读区工具栏":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=阅读区工具栏","title":"阅读区工具栏","body":"每篇文档右上角都有一排按钮：\n\n- **复制路径**：复制该文档在仓库中的路径，便于在编辑器里打开\n- **编辑 MD**：打开双栏编辑器——左侧 Markdown 源码按格式分色（标题层级、列表、代码块、公式），右侧实时预览（Mermaid、PacketDiag、KaTeX 公式、代码高亮）；`Ctrl+S` 直接写回 `docs/md/` 源文件（预览服务会自动重建），也支持另存为、下载、复制、还原与重新加载\n- **下载 MD**：下载当前页面对应的 Markdown 源文件\n- **下载本页**：把当前文档导出为自包含 HTML（含图片、图形与目录，可离线转发）\n- **宽屏阅读** / **隐藏序号**：切换阅读布局与标题编号\n\n编辑器常用快捷键：`Ctrl+B` 加粗 · `Ctrl+I` 斜体 · `Ctrl+K` 链接 · `Ctrl+M` 行内公式 · `Ctrl+Shift+M` 公式块 · `Ctrl+Alt+1/2/3` 标题 · `Ctrl+Shift+U`/`Ctrl+Shift+O` 无序/有序列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+K` 任务列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+C` 代码块 · `Ctrl+Shift+G` Mermaid · `Ctrl+Shift+D` PacketDiag · `Ctrl+S` 保存 · `Ctrl+/` 全部快捷键。\n\n> 直连保存仅在 `python serve.py` 的本机预览下可用（局域网其他机器访问时接口拒绝写入）；`file://` 双击模式会改为「保存到文件」或下载。\n\n左侧栏顶部还有「绘图预览」入口（<a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lib/plot-playground.html</a>），可在线试写 Mermaid / PacketDiag 并下载图片。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"阅读区工具栏"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=ai-助手":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=ai-助手","title":"AI 助手","body":"右下角「AI 助手」按钮（或 `Ctrl+Shift+A`）打开对话面板：它会先在本地 `search-index.json` 中检索相关章节，再把资料片段与问题一起发给您配置的大模型，回答下方列出引用来源，点击即可跳转。\n\n配置入口在**左侧栏顶部的 `AI 配置` 图标**（对话面板右上角「⚙ 配置」同样可打开），包含：\n\n- **服务商与密钥**：OpenAI 兼容 / DeepSeek / Ollama 本机 / Anthropic / 自定义，填写接口地址、模型、API Key、温度、系统提示与请求方式，点「保存并测试」验证连通性\n- **资料范围**：按文件夹/文档勾选，回答只依据所选资料（不勾选 = 使用全部文档）\n- **上传文档**：可选择本机的 `.md` / `.markdown` / `.txt` 加入检索（单个 ≤ 256 KB、合计 ≤ 512 KB，仅保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会上传或提交到仓库）；上传文档会出现在资料范围的「upload://」分组中\n- API Key 只保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会写入仓库或上传服务端；公开仓库请勿把 Key 提交进任何文件\n- 请求方式默认「自动」：浏览器直连失败（通常是跨域）时自动改走本机 `serve.py` 的 `/__ai/chat` 代理（仅本机可调用）\n- 完全离线（双击 `index.html`）时检索仍可用，但调用模型需要网络，且只能直连、不能走本机代理\n- 快捷动作：「总结本页」「文档概览」「解释选中」（选中正文文字后点击）","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"AI 助手"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=数学公式":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=数学公式","title":"数学公式","body":"行内公式用 `$...$`，独立公式块用 `$$...$$`，由 KaTeX 离线渲染：\n\n行内：$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\n\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-x^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"数学公式"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=目录约定":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=目录约定","title":"目录约定","body":"- `docs/md/` 是唯一需要维护的目录，可自由创建子文件夹\n- 图片无需登记，放在文档旁边或任意位置，用相对路径引用即可，例如 `![](images/flow.png)`\n- 构建只处理 `.md` 文档；图片由浏览器直接加载","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"目录约定"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=构建与预览":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=构建与预览","title":"构建与预览","body":"python setup_docsify.py\npython serve.py\n\n也可以直接双击 `docs/index.html` 浏览（file:// 模式，内容与搜索索引已内嵌）：该模式为**离线只读**，保留搜索、图形、公式与下载能力。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"构建与预览"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=登录与编辑权限":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=登录与编辑权限","title":"登录与编辑权限","body":"只读预览（`python serve.py`）不提供任何写接口。需要网页编辑时，用认证服务启动：\n\npython -m pip install -r server/requirements.txt     # 仅服务机需要（Flask + Waitress）\npython3 serve.py                                     # Linux 推荐用 python3（3.8+ 可开认证编辑；3.6 只会读预览）\npython serve.py                                      # Windows / 默认启动认证编辑服务（配置不存在会自动生成）\npython serve.py --preview                            # 只读预览（无写接口）\n\n启动后刷新页面：\n\n1. 侧栏顶部「设置」→ 用管理员账号登录（首次为 **admin / admin**，登录后请立即在窗口底部修改密码）。\n2. 在「SVN 认证路径」填入管理员准备的路由（必须是**强制账号密码认证**的路径，可点「测试认证路径」验证；允许匿名访问的路径会被拒绝）。\n3. 在「仓库映射」中填写 docs 目录与 SVN 地址（按目录段最长前缀匹配，如 `md/硬件设计` → hardware 库）。\n4. 按需填写「AI 助手」默认值（接口地址/模型/Key，会下发给所有登录用户），保存即可生效，无需重启。\n\n之后：\n\n- 匿名读者仍可浏览、搜索、下载；右上角显示「登录」。\n- 编辑者用**自己的 SVN 账号密码**登录（服务端通过认证路径验证，口令不落库、不缓存、不进命令行）。\n- 登录后打开编辑器：`Ctrl+S` 保存的是**个人草稿**（带版本号，其他标签页或本人更新会让旧版本保存返回冲突，不会覆盖）；工具条提供「历史」（草稿版本列表，可载入任一版本）、「差异」（已发布版本 ↔ 当前草稿的统一差异）、「载入最新」「放弃草稿」。草稿不会进入站点与搜索索引。\n- **插入图片**：工具栏「图片」可多选文件；在源码区直接 `Ctrl+V` 粘贴剪贴板图片也可。登录后图片自动保存到**当前文档同目录的 `img/`**（不存在会创建、重名自动加 `-1`），并插入 `![名称](img/文件名)`；离线（file://）模式改为内嵌 data URL 并在状态栏说明。\n- **没有 SVN 基线也能编辑**：文档在 `docs/md` 中尚未发布或所在目录未关联仓库时，编辑器会给出提示，可直接编辑并用 `Ctrl+S` 保存草稿；提交 SVN 时会作为新文件加入。\n- **提交 SVN**：编辑器右上角「提交 SVN…」→ 填写提交说明 → 审阅面板显示目标库、精确文件与统一差异 → 点「确认提交」用**自己的 SVN 账号**提交；成功后站点会自动重建。提交只包含这篇文档，不会夹带其他文件夹或其他人的改动；远端基线过期时会明确报错而不是覆盖。「SVN 日志」可按当前账号查看目标库日志。\n- **管理员**使用本机账号（默认 `admin / admin`）登录后同样可以编辑；提交时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号用于本次提交（口令只留在服务进程内存，立即用于验证与提交，不写入数据库）。\n- 会话默认 8 小时有效、闲置 30 分钟失效；服务重启后需重新登录。\n- 写接口全部经过登录 + CSRF 校验；源文件写回使用版本校验，不再有\"再次保存强制覆盖\"。\n- 修改 SVN 认证路径会让已有 SVN 用户会话失效（管理员会话保留以便继续配置）。\n\n> 阶段一（登录与只读边界）、阶段二（个人草稿、版本历史、差异）与阶段三（多库提交、私有工作副本、外部同步）已实现。工程师生成本地编辑与 SVN 提交的习惯不受影响，网站也不采集本地编辑过程。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"登录与编辑权限"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=界面小技巧":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=界面小技巧","title":"界面小技巧","body":"- 阅读区右上角的按钮行（复制路径 / 查看源码 / 编辑 MD / 下载 MD / 下载本页 / 显示序号）在向下滚动时会**固定在顶部**。\n- 「查看源码」无需登录：弹出窗口直接显示当前文档的 Markdown 源码，可编辑、实时预览，并「保存到本地」（不会改动服务端文档）。\n- 从搜索结果进入阅读模式时，命中工具条与按钮行会上下并排显示，互不遮挡；离开阅读模式后按钮行回到顶部。\n- 右侧「本文目录」固定**贴着窗口右缘**；其左边缘是可用鼠标拖动的调节线，向左拖变宽、向右拖变窄（宽度记忆在本机，刷新后保持）。\n- 搜索框放大镜右侧的 ⚙ 图标用于展开/收起「范围 / 模式」筛选（默认收起节省空间，筛选生效时图标高亮）。\n- 导出的独立 HTML 中，本文目录固定在**左侧导航**，正文在右侧滚动。目录会**高亮当前阅读的章节**并自动展开其上级；右上角有「隐藏」按钮，隐藏后屏幕右缘会出现「目录」小标签，点击即可恢复。分级标题左侧的箭头可折叠/展开子章节。\n- 绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可把左侧源码一键复制回文档；绘图示例中的每个图形都配有源码对照。\n- AI 助手面板：上传文档入口在**输入框上方**（不在配置弹窗里）；「历史」可查看与切换本机保存的历史对话，「新对话」开始一份新记录。\n- 设置入口：侧栏顶部 HOME 图标旁的单个「设置」图标（含 AI 配置）。窗口内可配置：**我的 AI 设置**（服务商/接口/模型/Key/代理策略/**参考源码路径**/资料范围，仅存本机浏览器）、**服务端设置**（管理员登录后配置 SVN 认证路径、仓库映射与全站 AI 默认值）、管理员改密。\n- 管理员登录：**本机管理员账号（默认 `admin / admin`）不需要 SVN 校验**，用页面右上角「登录」或设置窗口即可登录；侧栏会显示「管理员（本机）」。本机账号只能**本地编辑与保存草稿**；「提交 SVN…」时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号（仅本次合入使用，留在服务进程内存），因为仓库写入始终以真实 SVN 身份记录。\n- 首页（`#/`）由构建生成，编辑器只提供只读预览并提示改从左侧目录打开 `docs/md` 下的文档；文档路由不带 `.md`（docsify 会去掉后缀）也能正常编辑与保存。\n- 「参考源码路径」会随提问一起发给模型（如 `D:/repo/firmware` 或 `/srv/src/project`），便于 AI 回答时引用代码库位置。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"界面小技巧"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=代码高亮":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=代码高亮","title":"代码高亮","body":"print(\"hello md2web\")","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"代码高亮"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=mermaid-图形":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=mermaid-图形","title":"Mermaid 图形","body":"围栏语言写 `mermaid` 即渲染为图形（离线本地渲染）：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[编写 Markdown] --> B[运行构建]\n  B --> C[离线浏览与搜索]","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"Mermaid 图形"}},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md":{"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=绘图示例":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=绘图示例","title":"绘图示例","body":"本文给出文档站支持的**全部绘图样例**：27 种 Mermaid 图形类型与 11 个 PacketDiag 模板，每个都提供「效果 + 源码」对照。源码可直接复制到 <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a> 中修改后再贴回文档。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"绘图示例"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=mermaid-图形（27-种类型）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=mermaid-图形（27-种类型）","title":"Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）","body":"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-flowchart-流程图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-flowchart-流程图","title":"1. flowchart 流程图","body":"语法要点：节点 A[文本]、判断 B{条件}、子图 subgraph\n\n效果：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n\n源码：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"1. flowchart 流程图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-sequencediagram-时序图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-sequencediagram-时序图","title":"2. sequenceDiagram 时序图","body":"语法要点：participant 参与者、->> 请求、-->> 响应\n\n效果：\n\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n\n源码：\n\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"2. sequenceDiagram 时序图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-classdiagram-类图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-classdiagram-类图","title":"3. classDiagram 类图","body":"语法要点：class 类、+属性/+方法、<|-- 继承\n\n效果：\n\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n\n源码：\n\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"3. classDiagram 类图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-statediagram-v2-状态图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-statediagram-v2-状态图","title":"4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图","body":"语法要点：[*] 起止状态、A --> B: 事件\n\n效果：\n\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n\n源码：\n\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-erdiagram-er-图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-erdiagram-er-图","title":"5. erDiagram ER 图","body":"语法要点：实体 ||--o{ 关系 : 标签、属性块\n\n效果：\n\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n\n源码：\n\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"5. erDiagram ER 图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-journey-用户旅程":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-journey-用户旅程","title":"6. journey 用户旅程","body":"语法要点：section 阶段、任务: 评分: 角色\n\n效果：\n\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n\n源码：\n\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"6. journey 用户旅程"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-gantt-甘特图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-gantt-甘特图","title":"7. gantt 甘特图","body":"语法要点：dateFormat、section、任务: 状态, id, 开始, 时长\n\n效果：\n\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n\n源码：\n\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"7. gantt 甘特图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-pie-饼图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-pie-饼图","title":"8. pie 饼图","body":"语法要点：pie title、\"标签\" : 数值\n\n效果：\n\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n\n源码：\n\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"8. pie 饼图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-quadrantchart-四象限":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-quadrantchart-四象限","title":"9. quadrantChart 四象限","body":"语法要点：x-axis/y-axis、quadrant-1..4、数据点 [x, y]\n\n效果：\n\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n\n源码：\n\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"9. quadrantChart 四象限"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-requirementdiagram-需求图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-requirementdiagram-需求图","title":"10. requirementDiagram 需求图","body":"语法要点：requirement { id/text/risk/verifymethod }、element、关系；文本值需加引号\n\n效果：\n\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n\n源码：\n\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"10. requirementDiagram 需求图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-gitgraph-提交图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-gitgraph-提交图","title":"11. gitGraph 提交图","body":"语法要点：commit、branch、checkout、merge\n\n效果：\n\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n\n源码：\n\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"11. gitGraph 提交图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_12-mindmap-思维导图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_12-mindmap-思维导图","title":"12. mindmap 思维导图","body":"语法要点：root((中心)) 与缩进层级\n\n效果：\n\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n\n源码：\n\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"12. mindmap 思维导图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_13-timeline-时间线":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_13-timeline-时间线","title":"13. timeline 时间线","body":"语法要点：标题、时间 : 事件 : 事件\n\n效果：\n\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n\n源码：\n\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"13. timeline 时间线"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_14-sankey-桑基图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_14-sankey-桑基图","title":"14. sankey 桑基图","body":"语法要点：CSV 三列：来源,目标,数值\n\n效果：\n\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n\n源码：\n\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"14. sankey 桑基图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_15-xychart-xy-图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_15-xychart-xy-图","title":"15. xychart XY 图","body":"语法要点：x-axis 分类、y-axis 范围、bar/line 数据\n\n效果：\n\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n\n源码：\n\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"15. xychart XY 图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_16-block-块图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_16-block-块图","title":"16. block 块图","body":"语法要点：columns 列数、块定义、--> 连线\n\n效果：\n\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n\n源码：\n\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"16. block 块图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_17-packet-报文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_17-packet-报文图","title":"17. packet 报文图","body":"语法要点：packet-beta、位范围: \"字段\"\n\n效果：\n\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n\n源码：\n\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"17. packet 报文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_18-architecture-架构图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_18-architecture-架构图","title":"18. architecture 架构图","body":"语法要点：group/service(icon)[标题]、:L -- R: 连线\n\n效果：\n\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n\n源码：\n\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"18. architecture 架构图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_19-c4-上下文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_19-c4-上下文图","title":"19. C4 上下文图","body":"语法要点：Person/System/Rel 声明\n\n效果：\n\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n\n源码：\n\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"19. C4 上下文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_20-kanban-看板":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_20-kanban-看板","title":"20. kanban 看板","body":"语法要点：列[标题] 与缩进任务[描述]\n\n效果：\n\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n\n源码：\n\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"20. kanban 看板"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_21-radar-雷达图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_21-radar-雷达图","title":"21. radar 雷达图","body":"语法要点：axis id[\"维度\"]、curve id[\"名称\"]{数值}、max 上限\n\n效果：\n\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n\n源码：\n\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"21. radar 雷达图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_22-treemap-矩形树图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_22-treemap-矩形树图","title":"22. treemap 矩形树图","body":"语法要点：层级标题 + \"叶子\": 数值\n\n效果：\n\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n\n源码：\n\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"22. treemap 矩形树图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_23-wardley-战略图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_23-wardley-战略图","title":"23. wardley 战略图","body":"语法要点：anchor/component 名称 [可见度, 演进度]、-> 依赖（名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n\n源码：\n\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"23. wardley 战略图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_24-cynefin-决策域":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_24-cynefin-决策域","title":"24. cynefin 决策域","body":"语法要点：complex/complicated/clear/chaotic/confusion 与条目\n\n效果：\n\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n\n源码：\n\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"24. cynefin 决策域"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_25-eventmodeling-事件建模":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_25-eventmodeling-事件建模","title":"25. eventmodeling 事件建模","body":"语法要点：tf 序号 类型 名称（ui/cmd/evt/readmodel 等，名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n\n源码：\n\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"25. eventmodeling 事件建模"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_26-treeview-目录树":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_26-treeview-目录树","title":"26. treeView 目录树","body":"语法要点：treeView-beta 与缩进层级（带 / 为目录）\n\n效果：\n\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n\n源码：\n\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"26. treeView 目录树"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_27-info-版本信息":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_27-info-版本信息","title":"27. info 版本信息","body":"语法要点：仅显示 Mermaid 版本\n\n效果：\n\ninfo\n\n源码：\n\ninfo\n\n> 未包含的实验类型（如 `venn`、`ishikawa`、`railroad-*`、`flowchart-elk`）在当前 Mermaid 版本下不稳定或需要额外插件，绘图预览页的下拉框中亦未收录。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"27. info 版本信息"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=packetdiag-报文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=packetdiag-报文图","title":"PacketDiag 报文图","body":"围栏语言写 `packetdiag`，使用标准 [packetdiag](http://blockdiag.com/en/nwdiag/packetdiag-examples.html) 语法；字段格式为 `bit[-end]: 标签 [选项]`。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"PacketDiag 报文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-默认-64-字节报文（packet）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-默认-64-字节报文（packet）","title":"1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-tcp-头部（tcp）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-tcp-头部（tcp）","title":"2. TCP 头部（tcp）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"2. TCP 头部（tcp）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-ipv4-头部（ipv4）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-ipv4-头部（ipv4）","title":"3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-udp-头部（udp）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-udp-头部（udp）","title":"4. UDP 头部（udp）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"4. UDP 头部（udp）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-以太网帧头（ethernet）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-以太网帧头（ethernet）","title":"5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-标准示例（standard）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-标准示例（standard）","title":"6. 标准示例（standard）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"6. 标准示例（standard）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-扩展：位序反转-bit_order-desc":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-扩展：位序反转-bit_order-desc","title":"7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-扩展：按行编号-numbering-local":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-扩展：按行编号-numbering-local","title":"8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-扩展：区段-row-left-注释":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-扩展：区段-row-left-注释","title":"9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-扩展：desctable-描述表":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-扩展：desctable-描述表","title":"10. 扩展：desctable 描述表","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"10. 扩展：desctable 描述表"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-扩展：字段属性演示":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-扩展：字段属性演示","title":"11. 扩展：字段属性演示","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"11. 扩展：字段属性演示"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=常用选项":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=常用选项","title":"常用选项","body":"| 选项 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `color` | 填充色 | `[color = \"#dbeafe\"]` |\n| `textcolor` | 文字色 | `[textcolor = \"red\"]` |\n| `rotate` | 标签旋转 90/270 | `[rotate = 270]` |\n| `colheight` | 高度倍数 1–12 | `[colheight = 3]` |\n| `label` | 显示名 | `[label = \"Src Port\"]` |\n| `description` | 生成字段说明表 | `[description = \"RFC 793\"]` |\n| `style` | 边框样式 | `[style = \"dashed\"]` |","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"常用选项"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=全局配置与增强语法":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=全局配置与增强语法","title":"全局配置与增强语法","body":"| 语法 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `colwidth = 32;` | 每列宽度 |\n| `node_height = 48;` | 行高 |\n| `default_fontsize = 12;` | 默认字号 |\n| `scale_interval = 10;` | 位标尺间隔 |\n| `numbering = \"global\"` / `\"local\"` | 全局编号 / 按行编号 |\n| `bit_order = \"desc\"` | 位序反转（配合升序范围使用） |\n| `// @row: 名称` | 按行分段标题 |\n| `// @left: 文本` | 左侧注释 |\n| `desctable { 名称 = \"说明\" }` | 字段说明表 |\n\n> 图形均可点击放大查看；Mermaid 支持下载 SVG / PNG，PacketDiag 支持下载 PNG。绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可一键把源码复制回文档；阅读区右上角的「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML 文件。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"全局配置与增强语法"}},"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md":{"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=寄存器手册":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=寄存器手册","title":"寄存器手册","body":"本文档描述芯片内各模块的寄存器定义与读写约束。","route":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md","pageTitle":"寄存器手册","headingTitle":"寄存器手册"},"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=地址映射":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=地址映射","title":"地址映射","body":"基址寄存器的读写通过 MMIO 完成，偏移地址见下表。所有寄存器默认小端排列。\n\n配置寄存器前需复位对应时钟域，否则写入可能被忽略。","route":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md","pageTitle":"寄存器手册","headingTitle":"地址映射"},"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=中断控制器":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=中断控制器","title":"中断控制器","body":"中断使能寄存器位于偏移 0x100，未屏蔽前不产生中断请求。\n\n状态寄存器为只读，写 1 清除对应中断标志。","route":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md","pageTitle":"寄存器手册","headingTitle":"中断控制器"},"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=引脚复用":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=引脚复用","title":"引脚复用","body":"引脚功能选择寄存器默认关闭所有复用功能，上电后引脚处于高阻状态。","route":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md","pageTitle":"寄存器手册","headingTitle":"引脚复用"},"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=电气特性":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md?id=电气特性","title":"电气特性","body":"工作电压范围 1.8V 至 3.3V，超出范围可能损坏器件。","route":"/md/硬件设计/寄存器手册.md","pageTitle":"寄存器手册","headingTitle":"电气特性"}},"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md":{"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=时钟树设计":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=时钟树设计","title":"时钟树设计","body":"","route":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md","pageTitle":"时钟树设计","headingTitle":"时钟树设计"},"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=pll配置":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=pll配置","title":"PLL配置","body":"PLL 倍频系数写入配置寄存器后需等待锁定指示位。\n\n分频寄存器控制各外设时钟域的分频比。","route":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md","pageTitle":"时钟树设计","headingTitle":"PLL配置"},"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=低功耗模式":{"slug":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md?id=低功耗模式","title":"低功耗模式","body":"时钟门控用于低功耗模式，关断空闲外设的时钟。","route":"/md/硬件设计/时钟树设计.md","pageTitle":"时钟树设计","headingTitle":"低功耗模式"}},"/md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md":{"/md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md?id=编译工具链":{"slug":"/md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md?id=编译工具链","title":"编译工具链","body":"内容","route":"/md/软件工具链/编译工具链.md","pageTitle":"编译工具链","headingTitle":"编译工具链"}},"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md":{"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md?id=仿真环境搭建":{"slug":"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md?id=仿真环境搭建","title":"仿真环境搭建","body":"","route":"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md","pageTitle":"仿真环境搭建","headingTitle":"仿真环境搭建"},"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md?id=步骤一":{"slug":"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md?id=步骤一","title":"步骤一","body":"内容\nflowchart LR\n    %% 定义全局样式\n    classDef box fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#5A8FD3,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#2A5CAA,font-size:13px;\n    classDef subGraphStyle fill:#F0F4F8,stroke:#5A8FD3,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;\n\n    %% ----------------阶段一：Ingress 处理----------------\n    subgraph INGRESS [1. CPP Ingress Pipeline / 报文进入端]\n        direction LR\n        HMN(\"HPP MACI NOC\"):::box\n        AM_IN(\"AUX MAC\"):::box\n        CPIS_IN(\"CPIS\"):::box\n        IPDP(\"IPFIX DP\"):::box\n        \n        CM_IN(\"CPP MACI\"):::box\n        CIP(\"CPP Ingress Pipeline\"):::box\n        CMIRX(\"CPP MIRX\"):::box\n        \n        %% Ingress 本地的 HPP 旁路流向\n        CMN(\"CPP MACI NOC\"):::box\n        HIMR(\"HPP Ingress<br>MACI RX x16\"):::box\n\n        HMN -- \"HPP EGRESS<br>MIRROR x1\" --> CM_IN\n        AM_IN -- \"AUX CPU报文/标准二三层报文/<br>带互通头二三层报文 x2\" --> CM_IN\n        CPIS_IN -- \"FW CPU报文/<br>HOST CPU报文 x1\" --> CM_IN\n        IPDP -- \"IPFIX 报文 x1\" --> CM_IN\n\n        CM_IN -- \"标准/带互通头<br>二三层报文\" --> CMN --> HIMR\n        CM_IN -- \"CPU报文/<br>EGRESS MIRROR报文\" --> CIP --> CMIRX\n    end\n\n    %% ----------------阶段二：核心调度与跨 DIE----------------\n    subgraph FABRIC [2. XMMU & Fabric / 核心调度与跨DIE层]\n        direction LR\n        XMMU(\"XMMU\"):::box\n        CMCE(\"CPP MCE\"):::box\n        SUCIE_OUT(\"SPARE UCIE x2<br>(跨DIE输出)\"):::box\n        \n        UCIE_IN(\"N/E DATA UCIE X16<br>N/E SPARE UCIE X1<br>(其他DIE输入)\"):::box\n\n        %% 来自 Ingress 的输入\n        CMIRX -- \"跨DIE报文\" --> SUCIE_OUT\n        CMIRX -- \"本DIE报文、<br>MIRROR报文\" --> XMMU\n        \n        %% 来自其他 DIE 的输入\n        UCIE_IN --> XMMU\n        \n        XMMU --> CMCE\n        CMCE --> SUCIE_OUT\n    end\n\n    %% ----------------阶段三：Egress 处理----------------\n    subgraph EGRESS [3. CPP Egress Pipeline / 报文发送端]\n        direction LR\n        CTM(\"CPP TM\"):::box\n        CMITX(\"CPP MITX\"):::box\n        CEP(\"CPP Egress Pipeline\"):::box\n        CM_OUT(\"CPP MACI\"):::box\n        \n        SP_HPP(\"SP HPP Egress x1\"):::box\n        \n        AM_OUT(\"AUX MAC\"):::box\n        CPIS_OUT(\"CPIS\"):::box\n\n        %% MCE 与 XMMU 向 TM (Traffic Manager) 注入报文\n        CMCE --> CTM\n        XMMU -- \"上送CPU报文\" --> CTM\n        \n        CTM --> CMITX --> CEP --> CM_OUT\n        \n        SP_HPP -- \"AUX 普通二三层<br>出端口报文\" --> CM_OUT\n        \n        CM_OUT --> AM_OUT\n        CM_OUT --> CPIS_OUT\n    end\n    \n    %% 应用子图样式 (兼容部分 Mermaid 渲染器)\n    class INGRESS,FABRIC,EGRESS subGraphStyle;","route":"/md/验证指南/仿真环境搭建.md","pageTitle":"仿真环境搭建","headingTitle":"步骤一"}}}};
